   "md": "Screening (20k subsample, SVM C=1, paired folds): nothing beats plain word 1-2-gram TF-IDF by more than noise. Clear losers: unigrams only (-1.2pp), raw tf (-0.4pp), no idf (-0.4pp), **head block (-0.3pp)**. Neutral: digit masking, min_doc_count=5 (halves features for free), surface stats, char n-grams (+0.07pp at 4x cost). Also: char n-grams with 4 forked workers OOM-killed the run -> per-variant caching + fewer workers.",
